{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the original music I composed for Forgotten Beginnings: A New Afterlife. The price is a bit higher than other game soundtracks, since the game is free I am viewing the OST as a &quot;support me&quot; DLC where you are paying what I consider to be a fair price for my investment in making the game (time + money) and you get something extra in return. It's all done with NES VST and an extra vibrato plugin to give it a more unique sound, it is not NES authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes FLAC, WAV and MP3 versions of the album.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866980?t=1752279040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866980?t=1752279040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866980/4e46ab4f93c8fda28426c2232927173c878fb6fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752279040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866980/4e46ab4f93c8fda28426c2232927173c878fb6fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752279040","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the original music I composed for Forgotten Beginnings: A New Afterlife. The price is a bit higher than other game soundtracks, since the game is free I am viewing the OST as a &quot;support me&quot; DLC where you are paying what I consider to be a fair price for my investment in making the game (time + money) and you get something extra in return. It's all done with NES VST and an extra vibrato plugin to give it a more unique sound, it is not NES authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes FLAC, WAV and MP3 versions of the album.</p>","developers":["james5272"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3866660","name":"Forgotten Beginnings: A New Afterlife"},"header_image":"https://shared.akam